      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "centurion",
      "text": "We are Rome. The last of the Republic's legions. We held the north against him."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "centurion",
      "text": "Castus bought his new legions from the Iron Crown. Men who do not bleed... who do not stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "centurion",
      "text": "When the north falls, he marches on the city... and crowns himself."
